From: Xbox360 Blades <xbox360-blades@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 09:59:44 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 22/55] Create profile: AddXboxLive status page, as
 createprofile.xex shows it

Save Gamer Profile's buttons now open AddXboxLive.xur, a half-width Guide
page (hudbkgnd FullToHalf, HUD_close) with its wait cursor and status line:
Creating profile, Signing in, Updating profile, and for Join Xbox Live
Checking network status before Can't Connect. The profile is created and
signed in as those steps run; message boxes over it slide from the half
Guide (HalfToError / ErrorToHalf), Cancel/No return to Save Gamer Profile.
A small scheduler thread runs the steps. Also: after a box, only the Guide's
own Exit / Turn Off boxes go back to its menu.

